          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Alchemy"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "Vilree has used her alchemy ability to create 4 moderate acid flasks, 6 moderate alchemist's fire, 2 moderate bottled lightnings, 3 lesser elixirs of life, and 2 lesser tanglefoot bags. These are infusions. She can spend an action to create an additional vial of any one of these items, or any of the items listed as formulas in her book."
            },
